    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 28.42,
      "end": 31.52,
      "text": "God looked down and saw the most beautiful rose.",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 32.02,
      "end": 36.04,
      "text": "So beautiful that he picked it to have it in heaven all for himself.",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 38.08,
      "end": 40.1,
      "text": "Then there's the science, biocentrism.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 40.1,
      "end": 45.46,
      "text": "And we're all living and dying in infinite universes all at the same time.",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
